      <content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">
        <p>证据 A · 隔离环境逐项复现</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="206" width="400" height="200">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">RTX 3090 隔离环境</span>，代码/数据/权重/环境逐项 SHA 核验、身份去重与角色零交集。</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">SemStamp 258 个等价门</span>（unit/region/mask/hit/z-score）、<span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">SimMark 240 个等价门</span>（预处理/cosine/soft count/z-score）<span bold="true" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)">全部一致</span>。</p>
        <p>接口审计同时确认：两系统数学上都是<span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">一阶相邻跨度 pair-score 之和</span>，属同一检测器类。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="164" width="400" height="30">
      <content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">
        <p>证据 B · 逐层排除工程假设</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="206" width="400" height="200">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
        <p>逐版本隔离 adapter、Python 状态管理、pair 物化、batch 并行、跨文档复用——<span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">均被排除或不足以补足缺口</span>。</p>
        <p>最终外推预算 22.44 / 71.81 GPU-hours，超过 48h 门；<span bold="true" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)">真正限制是算力预算，不是算法正确性</span>。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <line startX="60" startY="430" endX="900" endY="430">
